<p data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"103\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"103\">Important – About the Rates</strong></span></p>
<p data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"457\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The published rates always represent the <strong data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"206\">total cost of the trip according to the number of people</strong> in the room.<br data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"222\">Even if it shows “double basis,” the system automatically displays the <strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"323\">final price for two people</strong>, or for three people in the case of a triple room.<br data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"377\">This way, the passenger sees the final amount with <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"456\">no need for calculations</strong>.<br><br></p>
