ario de llegada puede variar según condiciones de tránsito y clima. Disfrute el viaje y prepárese para vivir la experiencia Metele Brasil en Florianópolis.','1','Hotel Canas Gold',NULL,'Early Arrival Arrive at least 1 hours before departure for boarding and luggage check. The bus will leave punctually from the designated terminal. Luggage and Documents Each passenger is allowed 1 large suitcase (storage) and 1 hand luggage. A valid ID and digital voucher (printed or on mobile) must be presented. Minors must travel with legal authorization and an accompanying adult. Travel Recommendations There will be scheduled stops for meals, rest, and restroom use. Bring water, a jacket, a small pillow, and personal hygiene items. Wear comfortable clothing and avoid excessive alcohol or heavy food. Keep valuable items in sight at all times. ⚠️ Restrictions and Rules Smoking, alcohol consumption, and any substance use are prohibited. Pets are not allowed, except certified guide dogs. Avoid standing or walking while the bus is moving. Follow all instructions from the driver and trip coordinator. ♿ Accessibility Special assistance is available for passengers with reduced mobility; please notify in advance if required. ℹ️ Important Metele Brasil and transport companies are not responsible for lost belongings. Arrival time may vary depending on traffic and weather. Enjoy your journey and get ready for the Metele Brasil experience in Florianópolis.','Chegada antecipada de 1 hora de antecedência ao horário de saída para embarque e conferência de bagagem. O ônibus partirá pontualmente do terminal designado. Bagagem e Documentação Cada passageiro pode levar 1 mala grande (bagageiro) e 1 bagagem de mão. É obrigatório apresentar documento de identidade válido e voucher digital impresso ou no celular. Menores devem viajar acompanhados de um responsável legal e autorização, se necessário. Recomendações de viagem Durante o trajeto haverá paradas programadas para descanso, refeições e uso de ba